{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-199648-r4518275","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Pulled Pork Sandwiches","sourcePageId":199648,"sourceRevision":"4518275","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:19:55Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Pulled%20Pork%20Sandwiches&oldid=4518275","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:46:08.534Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Barbecue recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for sandwiches","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar","Category:Recipes using dehydrated lemon zest","Category:Recipes using honey","Category:Recipes using paprika","Category:Recipes using pepper","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes using rosemary","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Smoked recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"a4294a58e047275774238061015e0ae542b2a957a9a538f6cc7f72a12ee597e6","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Sandwich recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} \n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Barbecue recipes]] [[Category:Smoked recipes]]\n\nPlease don't try to do this in the oven 'cause you'll just ruin it.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Quart|quarts]] water\n* 12 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]] [[Cookbook:Pickling Salt|pickling salt]]\n* ¾ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* 6–8 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] Boston [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]] butt, trimmed\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 3 tbsp dehydrated [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] peel\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]] (more if you like)\n* 1 ½ tbsp dried [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n* 3 tbsp dark [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* Several lbs apple wood\n* Hamburger buns for serving\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine water, salt, and honey in a 6-quart cooler. Add pork and refrigerate or place a large bag of ice on top for 8–12 hours.\n#Remove pork from brine and pat dry with [[Cookbook:Paper Towel|paper towels]]. Combine remaining seasonings and rub on pork.\n#Light a few chunks of apple wood and place in the firebox of a smoker. Keep temperature in smoker around 210°F.\n#Place in a [[Cookbook:Smoker|smoker]] and cook for 8–12 hours, changing wood as needed. The meat should be tender at this point—if not, continue smoking.\n#Let rest 1 hour, then shred with two forks. Serve on hamburger buns.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for sandwiches]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using paprika]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dehydrated lemon zest]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Pulled Pork Sandwiches","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 quarts water","sourceText":"2 quarts water","amountText":"2 quarts water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"12 ounces pickling salt","sourceText":"12 ounces pickling salt","amountText":"12 ounces pickli